Output ../sandboxed-block.gif
Output ../sandboxed-block.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 4ms

Hide
Type "cd /workspace"
Enter
Show

Type "python3 labs/02-sleeper-memory/media/show.py sandboxed-block"
Enter
Sleep 14s
